  "prefLabel": "Ncr 215.03 Decision on Motion for Rehearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 215.03 Decision on Motion for Rehearing. The department shall grant or deny a motion for rehearing, or suspend the decision or order pending further consideration within 10 days of the filing of the motion for rehearing.\n\nSource. #14254, INTERIM, eff 5-23-25; ss by #14447, eff 12-4-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr200.html"
